      "refersTo": "topic-row",
      "description": "Compact connected-row primitive with inline JavaScript mark and selection glow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-topic\" aria-current=\"true\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"JavaScript\"><path fill=\"#F7DF1E\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"/><path fill=\"#000\" d=\"m6.31 20.057 1.837-1.11c.354.628.676 1.159 1.449 1.159.741 0 1.208-.29 1.208-1.417V11.03h2.254v7.69c0 2.334-1.369 3.397-3.365 3.397-1.803 0-2.85-.934-3.381-2.061m7.97-.241 1.836-1.063c.483.79 1.111 1.37 2.222 1.37.934 0 1.53-.468 1.53-1.112 0-.773-.612-1.047-1.643-1.498l-.563-.242c-1.626-.692-2.705-1.562-2.705-3.397 0-1.691 1.288-2.979 3.301-2.979 1.433 0 2.464.499 3.205 1.803l-1.755 1.127c-.387-.693-.805-.966-1.45-.966-.66 0-1.079.419-1.079.966 0 .676.42.95 1.385 1.369l.564.241c1.916.822 2.995 1.659 2.995 3.543 0 2.029-1.595 3.14-3.736 3.14-2.093 0-3.446-.998-4.106-2.302\"/></svg><span>JavaScript</span><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button>",
